#. module: web_disable_autosave
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_web_disable_autosave
msgid ""
"\n"
"Disable the automatic save of the web client:\n"
" - leaving the record (breadcrumb, menu, back button, links): ask to discard the changes or stay\n"
" - reloading or closing the browser tab: the browser asks before leaving, nothing is saved\n"
" - switching to another browser tab: nothing is saved\n"
" - record pager (next / previous) and New button: ask to discard the changes or stay\n"
" - editable lists: leaving the page with an edited row asks to discard it or stay\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Sens asekles awurman n umsaɣ web:\n"
" - tuffɣa seg ukalas (abrid n tunigin, umuɣ, taqeffalt n tuɣalin, iseɣwan): ad d-isteqsi ma ad ttwakksen yibeddilen neɣ ad teqqimeḍ\n"
" - allus n usali neɣ amdal n yiccer n yiminig: iminig ad d-isteqsi send tuffɣa, ulac ayen ara yettwaskelsen\n"
" - aɛeddi ɣer yiccer-nniḍen n yiminig: ulac ayen ara yettwaskelsen\n"
" - asmussu n yikalasen (uḍfir / uzwir) d tqeffalt Amaynut: ad d-isteqsi ma ad ttwakksen yibeddilen neɣ ad teqqimeḍ\n"
" - tibdarin yettwasẓergen: tuffɣa seg usebter s yizirig yettwabeddlen ad d-isteqsi ma ad yettwakkes neɣ ad teqqimeḍ\n"

#. module: web_disable_autosave
#: model:ir.module.module,shortdesc:base.module_web_disable_autosave
msgid "Disable Auto Save"
msgstr "Sens asekles awurman"

#. module: web_disable_autosave
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/web_disable_autosave/static/src/discard_dialog.js:0
msgid "Discard changes"
msgstr "Kkes ibeddilen"

#. module: web_disable_autosave
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/web_disable_autosave/static/src/discard_dialog.js:0
msgid "Stay here"
msgstr "Qqim da"

#. module: web_disable_autosave
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_web_disable_autosave
msgid ""
"Stop the automatic save of Odoo: records are only saved when the user clicks"
" Save"
msgstr ""
"Seḥbes asekles awurman n Odoo: ikalasen ttwaskelsen kan mi ara isit useqdac "
"ɣef Kles"

#. module: web_disable_autosave
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/web_disable_autosave/static/src/discard_dialog.js:0
msgid ""
"This record has unsaved changes. Discard them, or stay here and click Save "
"to keep them."
msgstr ""
"Akalas-a ɣur-s ibeddilen ur yettwaskelsen ara. Kkes-iten, neɣ qqim da syen "
"sit ɣef Kles akken ad ten-teǧǧeḍ."

#. module: web_disable_autosave
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/web_disable_autosave/static/src/discard_dialog.js:0
msgid "Unsaved changes"
msgstr "Ibeddilen ur yettwaskelsen ara"
